## Third-Party Notices

This project is derived from [weixin_search_mcp](https://github.com/fancyboi999/weixin_search_mcp)
by **mini** (fancyboi999), licensed under the MIT License.

The original project provides WeChat article search functionality via the Sogou
WeChat search engine. The core search logic (`http_client.py`, `weixin_search.py`)
is based on and adapted from the original work, with enhancements including
session management, anti-crawling measures, and conversion to Claude Code Skills.
